    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<div style="border-left:4px solid #2c3e50; padding:0.5em 1em; margin-bottom:1em; background:#eef1f4;"><b>Goal</b><p>A regatta is a series of boat races. At the Ōtaki regatta, the starter says go once and both crews begin at that signal. The timekeeper records the result only after both crews finish.</p></div>
